OL,3,AMichelin-starred Seoul restaurant fined
OL,4,Afor using ants as garnish
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two Michelin-starred restaurant in
OL,7,FSeoul has been fined for using ants as
OL,8,Fa dessert garnish.
OL,10,FThe owner of Evett in the South Korean
OL,11,Fcapital was fined 15 million won
OL,12,F(#8,144; $10,965), while the company
OL,13,Foperating the restaurant was fined 10
OL,14,Fmillion won for violating the Food
OL,15,FSanitation Act, local media report.
OL,17,FAnts are not among the 10 insect
OL,18,Fspecies approved for human consumption
OL,19,Fin the east Asian nation. The approved
OL,20,Flist includes grasshoppers, locusts and
OL,21,Fsome silkworms.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
