OL,3,AMichelin-starred Seoul restaurant fined
OL,4,Afor using ants as garnish
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors had sought a one-year
OL,7,Fprison term for the restaurant's owner,
OL,8,Fas well as a 20 million won fine - but
OL,9,Fthe judge took the owner admitting the
OL,10,Fcharge and having no prior criminal
OL,11,Frecord into account.
